#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-aks.rst:4
msgid ""
"You can use a supported `Azure Marketplace Container Offer "
"<https://azuremarketplace.microsoft.com/en-us/marketplace/apps/mattermost"
".mattermost-operator>`__ to install Mattermost on your existing Azure "
"infrastructure."
msgstr ""
"지원되는 `Azure Marketplace Container Offer "
"<https://azuremarketplace.microsoft.com/en-us/marketplace/apps/mattermost"
".mattermost-operator>`__\\ 를 사용하여 기존 Azure 인프라에 OKR.BEST를 설치할 수 "
"있습니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-aks.rst:7
msgid "Before you begin"
msgstr "시작하기 전에"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-aks.rst:9
msgid "Before deploying, make sure you have the following:"
msgstr "배포하기 전에 다음을 갖추고 있는지 확인하세요:"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-aks.rst:11
msgid ""
"**An AKS cluster**: with the `Application Gateway Ingress Controller "
"(AGIC) add-on <https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/application-"
"gateway/tutorial-ingress-controller-add-on-new>`_ enabled or another "
"Ingress controller deployed."
msgstr ""
"**AKS 클러스터**: `Application Gateway Ingress Controller(AGIC) 추가 기능 "
"<https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/application-gateway/tutorial-"
"ingress-controller-add-on-new>`_\\ 이 활성화되어 있거나 다른 Ingress "
"controller가 배포되어 있어야 합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-aks.rst:13
msgid ""
"**PostgreSQL v13.0+ database**: `Azure Database for PostgreSQL - Flexible"
" Server with Private Access <https://learn.microsoft.com/en-"
"us/azure/postgresql/>`_ is recommended. Deploy one by following `this "
"Microsoft quick start guide <https://learn.microsoft.com/en-"
"us/azure/postgresql/flexible-server/quickstart-create-server-portal>`_."
msgstr ""
"**PostgreSQL v13.0 이상 데이터베이스**: `Private Access가 적용된 Azure Database "
"for PostgreSQL - Flexible Server <https://learn.microsoft.com/en-"
"us/azure/postgresql/>`_\\ 를 권장합니다. `이 Microsoft 빠른 시작 가이드 "
"<https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/postgresql/flexible-"
"server/quickstart-create-server-portal>`_\\ 에 따라 하나를 배포하세요."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-aks.rst:15
msgid ""
"**Private Network Connectivity**: Verify that there is network "
"connectivity between your AKS cluster and the PostgreSQL database."
msgstr ""
"**사설 네트워크 연결**: AKS 클러스터와 PostgreSQL 데이터베이스 간에 네트워크 "
"연결이 있는지 확인하세요."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-aks.rst:17
msgid ""
"**Valid DNS name and TLS certificate**: You must have access to a DNS "
"zone and provide a valid TLS key and certificate for the Ingress "
"Controller."
msgstr ""
"**유효한 DNS 이름과 TLS 인증서**: DNS 영역에 접근할 수 있어야 하며 Ingress "
"Controller용 유효한 TLS 키와 인증서를 제공해야 합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-aks.rst:19
msgid ""
"**Node Capacity**: At least 2 AKS nodes for high availability when "
"deploying for 100 users or more."
msgstr ""
"**노드 용량**: 100명 이상을 위해 배포하는 경우 고가용성을 위한 최소 2개의 AKS "
"노드."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-aks.rst:21
msgid ""
"**License Key**: Trial or Enterprise license to test high availability "
"and other Enterprise features."
msgstr ""
"**라이선스 키**: 고가용성과 기타 Enterprise 기능을 테스트하기 위한 평가판 또는 "
"Enterprise 라이선스."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-aks.rst:24
msgid "Installation steps"
msgstr "설치 단계"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-aks.rst:26
msgid ""
"The installation process includes deploying Mattermost and updating the "
"server."
msgstr "설치 과정은 OKR.BEST를 배포하고 서버를 업데이트하는 것을 포함합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-aks.rst:29
msgid "Step 1: Deploy Mattermost"
msgstr "1단계: OKR.BEST 배포"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-aks.rst:31
msgid ""
"Deploy Mattermost from the `Azure Marketplace Container Offer "
"<https://azuremarketplace.microsoft.com/en-us/marketplace/apps/mattermost"
".mattermost-operator>`_ and select **Get it now**."
msgstr ""
"`Azure Marketplace Container Offer "
"<https://azuremarketplace.microsoft.com/en-us/marketplace/apps/mattermost"
".mattermost-operator>`_\\ 에서 OKR.BEST를 배포하고 **Get it now**\\ 를 "
"선택합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-aks.rst:33
msgid ""
"Alternatively, you can go to the ``Extensions + Applications`` section of"
" your AKS cluster and install the Mattermost offering from there. Visit "
"the `Microsoft cluster extensions documentation "
"<https://learn.microsoft.com/en-gb/azure/aks/cluster-extensions?tabs"
"=azure-cli>`_ to learn more."
msgstr ""
"또는 AKS 클러스터의 ``Extensions + Applications`` 섹션으로 이동하여 거기서 "
"OKR.BEST 제품을 설치할 수도 있습니다. 자세한 내용은 `Microsoft 클러스터 확장 문서 "
"<https://learn.microsoft.com/en-gb/azure/aks/cluster-extensions?tabs=azure-"
"cli>`_\\ 를 방문하세요."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-aks.rst:35
msgid ""
"Choose the **Resource Group** and the **Region** of your installed AKS "
"and PostgreSQL database."
msgstr ""
"설치된 AKS와 PostgreSQL 데이터베이스의 **Resource Group**\\ 과 **Region**\\ 을 "
"선택합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-aks.rst:37
msgid "An example of the Azure AKS Project details screen."
msgstr "Azure AKS Project 세부 정보 화면의 예시입니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-aks.rst:40
msgid "Choose your AKS cluster."
msgstr "AKS 클러스터를 선택합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-aks.rst:42
msgid "An example of the Azure AKS cluster setup screen."
msgstr "Azure AKS 클러스터 설정 화면의 예시입니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-aks.rst:45
msgid ""
"Fill in the details for your PostgreSQL database. Ensure the user "
"specified has full access."
msgstr ""
"PostgreSQL 데이터베이스의 세부 정보를 입력합니다. 지정한 사용자가 전체 접근 "
"권한을 갖고 있는지 확인하세요."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-aks.rst:47
msgid "An example of the Azure AKS Database setup screen."
msgstr "Azure AKS Database 설정 화면의 예시입니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-aks.rst:51
msgid ""
"Specify Deployment Details including Deployment Name and Deployment Size."
" You will need to configure file storage for your Mattermost instance. We"
" recommend using an S3-compatible storage service or an NFS-compatible "
"server."
msgstr ""
"Deployment Name과 Deployment Size를 포함한 배포 세부 정보를 지정합니다. OKR.BEST "
"인스턴스의 파일 저장소를 구성해야 합니다. S3 호환 스토리지 서비스나 NFS 호환 "
"서버 사용을 권장합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-aks.rst:53
msgid "An example of the Azure AKS Deployment Details setup screen."
msgstr "Azure AKS Deployment Details 설정 화면의 예시입니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-aks.rst:56
msgid ""
"Configure Mattermost installation hostname and Ingress details. The AGIC "
"add-on is used in the following example to show the ingress annotations "
"required."
msgstr ""
"OKR.BEST 설치 호스트 이름과 Ingress 세부 정보를 구성합니다. 다음 예시에서는 필요한 "
"ingress 주석을 보여주기 위해 AGIC 추가 기능을 사용합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-aks.rst:58
msgid ""
"You can use any pre-installed Ingress Controller in your cluster as long "
"as it supports Kubernetes Ingress and TLS termination."
msgstr ""
"Kubernetes Ingress와 TLS 종료를 지원하는 한, 클러스터에 사전 설치된 모든 Ingress "
"Controller를 사용할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-aks.rst:65
msgid "Additionally, we recommend considering:"
msgstr "추가로 다음을 고려할 것을 권장합니다:"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-aks.rst:67
msgid "Enforcing a minimum TLS version (e.g., TLS 1.2)."
msgstr "최소 TLS 버전 적용(예: TLS 1.2)."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-aks.rst:68
msgid ""
"Deploying a Web Application Firewall (WAF) for additional protection, if "
"supported by your ingress controller."
msgstr ""
"ingress controller가 지원하는 경우, 추가 보호를 위한 웹 애플리케이션 "
"방화벽(WAF) 배포."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-aks.rst:69
msgid "Limiting access using Kubernetes Network Policies."
msgstr "Kubernetes 네트워크 정책을 사용한 접근 제한."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-aks.rst:71
msgid "An example of the Azure AKS Networking Details setup screen."
msgstr "Azure AKS Networking Details 설정 화면의 예시입니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-aks.rst:74
msgid ""
"Ensure that everything is running. You should be able to check the "
"installed plugin from the **AKS Extensions + Applications** page under "
"the **Settings** menu."
msgstr ""
"모든 것이 실행 중인지 확인하세요. **Settings** 메뉴 아래의 **AKS Extensions + "
"Applications** 페이지에서 설치된 플러그인을 확인할 수 있어야 합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-aks.rst:76
msgid ""
"When the deployment is complete, obtain the hostname or IP address of "
"your Mattermost deployment using the following command:"
msgstr ""
"배포가 완료되면 다음 명령을 사용하여 OKR.BEST 배포의 호스트 이름이나 IP 주소를 "
"가져옵니다:"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-aks.rst:82
msgid ""
"Use your IP address from the ``ADDRESS`` column, and create a DNS record "
"in your domain registration service."
msgstr ""
"``ADDRESS`` 열의 IP 주소를 사용하여 도메인 등록 서비스에 DNS 레코드를 "
"생성하세요."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-aks.rst:84
msgid ""
"Access your working Mattermost installation at the URL you’ve determined "
"in your DNS record."
msgstr ""
"DNS 레코드에서 정한 URL에서 작동 중인 OKR.BEST 설치에 접근하세요."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-aks.rst:86
msgid ""
"Learn more about administrating your Mattermost server by visiting the "
":doc:`Administration Guide </administration-guide/administration-guide-"
"index>`."
msgstr ""
":doc:`관리 가이드 </administration-guide/administration-guide-index>`\\ 를 "
"방문하여 OKR.BEST 서버 관리에 대해 자세히 알아보세요."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-aks.rst:89
msgid "Step 2: Upgrade Mattermost via your AKS cluster"
msgstr "2단계: AKS 클러스터를 통해 OKR.BEST 업그레이드"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-aks.rst:91
msgid ""
"Visit the ``Extensions + Applications`` section of your AKS cluster where"
" your Mattermost installation is deployed."
msgstr ""
"OKR.BEST 설치가 배포된 AKS 클러스터의 ``Extensions + Applications`` 섹션을 "
"방문합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-aks.rst:92
msgid ""
"You can enable minor version auto upgrades since these are not updating "
"Mattermost version"
msgstr ""
"이러한 업그레이드는 OKR.BEST 버전을 업데이트하지 않으므로 마이너 버전 자동 "
"업그레이드를 활성화할 수 있습니다"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-aks.rst:93
msgid ""
"Expand the ``Configuration Settings`` table and add the below "
"configuration and the version you want to install as a value."
msgstr ""
"``Configuration Settings`` 표를 펼치고 아래 구성과 설치하려는 버전을 값으로 "
"추가합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-aks.rst:102
msgid "Select **Save** and wait for the upgrade."
msgstr "**Save**\\ 를 선택하고 업그레이드를 기다립니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-aks.rst:105
msgid "Looking for a sovereign deployment on Azure Local?"
msgstr "Azure Local의 주권적 배포를 찾고 있나요?"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-aks.rst:107
msgid ""
"For organizations requiring on-premises deployments with data "
"sovereignty, **Azure Local** (formerly Azure Stack HCI) provides a hybrid"
" cloud platform that enables you to run Mattermost on-premises while "
"maintaining integration with Microsoft Teams and M365."
msgstr ""
"데이터 주권을 갖춘 온프레미스 배포가 필요한 조직을 위해, **Azure Local**(이전 "
"명칭 Azure Stack HCI)은 Microsoft Teams 및 M365와의 통합을 유지하면서 OKR.BEST를 "
"온프레미스에서 실행할 수 있게 해주는 하이브리드 클라우드 플랫폼을 제공합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-aks.rst:109
msgid ""
"We recommend engaging **Mattermost Professional Services** for Azure "
"Local deployments to ensure optimal configuration and compliance with "
"your security requirements. `Talk to an Expert <https://mattermost.com"
"/contact-sales/>`_ to discuss your Azure Local deployment needs."
msgstr ""
"최적의 구성과 보안 요구 사항 준수를 보장하기 위해 Azure Local 배포에는 "
"**Mattermost Professional Services**\\ 를 활용할 것을 권장합니다. Azure Local "
"배포 요구 사항을 논의하려면 `전문가와 상담 <https://mattermost.com/contact-"
"sales/>`_\\ 하세요."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-aks.rst:113
msgid ""
"You are responsible for Azure costs associated with any infrastructure "
"you spin up to host a Mattermost server, and Azure credits cannot be "
"applied towards the purchase of a Mattermost license."
msgstr ""
"OKR.BEST 서버를 호스팅하기 위해 가동하는 모든 인프라와 관련된 Azure 비용은 "
"사용자의 책임이며, Azure 크레딧은 OKR.BEST 라이선스 구매에 적용할 수 없습니다."

